      <div type="clause" n="28.2f">
        <head>VI Atr (Latin Paraphrase) 28.2f</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">ire uidelicet, rixe, dissensiones, blasphemie, adulteria, homicidia, furta, rapine, necromantie, auaritie , fornicationes, periuria, sacrilegia, sortilegia, ebrietates, comesationes, idolatrie, falsa testimonia, fraudes subdole, maleficia, ueneficia, pondera dolosa, mensursæ inique, statere fraudulente cetereque pestes, que ad interitum hominem pertrahunt.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
